(1)  169/     27A :                     
(1)  170/     27A :                     gInsFm3	macro pitch,fmins
(1)  171/     27A :                     	dc.b $B0,pitch,((fmins>>16)&$FF),((fmins>>8)&$FF)
(1)  172/     27A :                     	dc.b fmins&$FF,$00,$00,$00
