(1) 1932/    10BC :                     ;
(1) 1933/    10BC :                     ; Notes:
(1) 1934/    10BC :                     ; - Initialize your graphics and VRAM location
(1) 1935/    10BC :                     ;   with Video_PrintInit
(1) 1936/    10BC :                     ; - Only Video_PrintW can be used in double-interlace
(1) 1937/    10BC :                     ;   mode.
